    "latest_update": "R-134 proves the sharp floor residual, the correctly post-cluster root/visit-free fixed-law action inequality, exact pointwise six-real negative-moment and sub-fourth-jet bounds, an embedded-Pauli D4 logarithmic obstruction, and the conditional gamma=7/12 geometric sum. It rejects both separate weighted-current absorption and pointwise-ellipticity-to-spatial-fractional transfer. Production terminal reservation with joint spatial data, owner intertwining, the signed forest-current theorem, R-087-to-R-088 atom transfer, the one-use ledger, collar-uniform headroom, production constants, low data, matching energy, strict gap, absolute anchor, and both A13 gates remain open.",
    "success_condition": "Prove A13-CLASSII-SIGNED-FOREST-TERMINAL-INNOVATION-ONE-USE-HEADROOM-BOUND. Retain common heat, replica-relative variance, all six signed Pauli--Fierz rows, trace, the R-063 forest, visits, roots, exhaustive output clusters, rational multipliers, the 2680/729 Cartan owner, low, source, and sextic exactly once. Keep the exhaustive cluster family inside each root-spatial direct sum and do not separate the cutoff-divergent signed forest-current components. Establish a refinement-uniform terminal innovation together with owner-uniform joint value-gradient, spatial increment, regression, Fubini, and Jensen data; prove the owner-preserving R-087-self-atom to R-088-sequential-atom transfer and the once-owned q_k ledger; and prove collar-uniform near/balanced headroom. Then use R-134 to compute the production constants, low matrix, matching energy, strict gap, and absolute anchor, apply R-129 once, and only then invoke R-093 toward OVERLAP_src and Nelson. Removals, interacting-measure construction, and Sector A remain open."
